<title>THAILAND: Bank of Ayudhya pays 2.25 baht H2 dividend.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ayudhya pays 2.25 baht H2 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Dividend (baht)   2.25    vs     2.25</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 26, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Bank of Ayudhya Plc, a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
</text>
